OL,3,APrimary teachers hired to teach Glasgow
OL,4,Asecondary pupils to read
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's ranking in the latest Pisa
OL,7,Finternational education study did not
OL,8,Fchange significantly between 2022 and
OL,9,F2025 but a long-term decline in reading
OL,10,Fstandards has not been reversed.
